  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Student Academic Freedom Regional Programme (SAFRAP) 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide student organizations in Southern Africa with a plattform where they can develop their participation and advocacy skills through policy engagement meetings, regional research (students/academic freedom), regional exchange, regional conference, training of students, develop regional learning platform.</narrative>
  </description>
